# Context

## Background
Admission in Engine.query never waits: a query that finds the slot taken
gets ErrBusy at once. The old tests started the slow query in a goroutine
and probed in parallel, so either query could win the slot.

## Why This Way
The test waits on Engine.active (set after the slot is taken) instead of
adding a hook to the engine. The engine behavior is correct and stays
unchanged.

